    output items will match the type of *start*:

        >>> from decimal import Decimal
        >>> start = Decimal('2.1')
        >>> stop = Decimal('5.1')
        >>> list(numeric_range(start, stop))
        [Decimal('2.1'), Decimal('3.1'), Decimal('4.1')]

